---

<section class="section portfolio-section" id="works" aria-labelledby="portfolio-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORKS</p>
      <h2 id="portfolio-heading">開発から保守まで。<br />これまでの実績。</h2>
      <p>C++によるアプリケーション開発から、業務システム、AI連携・自動化まで。案件ごとの担当範囲と使用技術を紹介します。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="portfolio-note">過去の担当案件と自主開発の実績を掲載しています。発注元・サービス固有名・画面・詳細仕様は公開せず、概要を紹介しています。</p>
    <div class="portfolio-grid">
      {projects.map((project, index) => (
        <article class="portfolio-card">
          <div class="portfolio-meta"><span>{project.category}</span><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span></div>
          <h3>{project.title}</h3>
          <p class="portfolio-period">{project.year} / {project.duration}</p>
          <p class="portfolio-overview">{project.overview}</p>
          <dl class="portfolio-role"><dt>担当範囲</dt><dd>{project.role}</dd></dl>
          <details class="portfolio-details">
            <summary>担当内容を見る</summary>
            <ul>{project.details.map((detail) => <li>{detail}</li>)}</ul>
          </details>
          <ul class="portfolio-tech" aria-label="使用技術">{project.tech.map((tech) => <li>{tech}</li>)}</ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section skills-section" id="skills" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
  <div class="shell skills-grid">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SKILLS</p><h2 id="skills-heading">実装する力と、<br />進める力。</h2><p>1名でのシステム開発と、チームでのプロジェクト推進。その両方の経験を活かします。</p></div>
    <dl class="skill-list">{skills.map((skill) => <div><dt>{skill.name}</dt><dd>{skill.text}</dd></div>)}</dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .portfolio-section { background: #faf8f9; }
  .portfolio-note { max-width: 54rem; margin: -1rem 0 2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .portfolio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .portfolio-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; }
  .portfolio-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; color: var(--pink-700); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .portfolio-meta span:last-child { color: var(--muted); font-family: Manrope, sans-serif; }
  .portfolio-card h3 { margin: 1.25rem 0 .65rem; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); line-height: 1.6; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .portfolio-period { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }
  .portfolio-overview { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.95; }
  .portfolio-role { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .portfolio-role dt { margin-bottom: .4rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .7rem; }
  .portfolio-role dd { margin: 0; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .portfolio-details { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .8rem; }
  .portfolio-details summary { width: fit-content; padding: .45rem 0; color: var(--pink-700); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .portfolio-details summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--pink-700); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .portfolio-details ul { margin: .7rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .portfolio-details li + li { margin-top: .4rem; }
  .portfolio-tech { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; margin: auto 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .portfolio-tech li { padding: .35rem .55rem; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--pink-50); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .7rem; }
  .skills-section { background: #fff; }
  .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .skill-list { margin: 0; }
  .skill-list div { padding: 1.4rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .skill-list div:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .skill-list dt { margin-bottom: .7rem; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .skill-list dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.95; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .portfolio-grid, .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
